<title>USA: ICC Q1 shr loss $0.08 vs loss $0.11.</title>
<headline>ICC Q1 shr loss $0.08 vs loss $0.11.</headline>
<dateline>HATBORO, Pa. 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.08     loss	 $0.11</p>
<p> Net loss		   1,689     loss	 1,886</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  21,316		   17,781</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Quarter ended March 31.</p>
<p>The company reported only the revenues of its joint-venture with Engelhard Corp, Engelhard/ICC, in which it holds a 50 percent interest. They were $2,678,000 in Q1 1997 and $2,076,000 in Q1 1996.</p>
<p>Full name of company is ICC Technologies Inc</p>
